<title>UK: SAATCHI &amp; SAATCHI WINS 7 MLN STG TEA ACCOUNT IN UK.</title>
<headline>SAATCHI &amp; SAATCHI WINS 7 MLN STG TEA ACCOUNT IN UK.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saatchi &amp; Saatchi Advertising said on Wednesday it had won a seven-million-pound ($11.1-million) UK account for Typhoo tea and London Herb &amp; Spice Company, which belong to Premier Beverages.</p>
<p>Saatchi &amp; Saatchi, which took the business away from incumbent Delaney Fletcher Bozell, had competed against Abbott Mead Vickers BBDO, Grey and WCRS.</p>
<p>-- London Advertising Newsdesk +44 171 542 2792 ($ = 0.633 British Pounds Sterling)</p>
</text>
